    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Vandalism deterrence</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A locked container provides a visible security deterrent and restricts unauthorized access. Open trailers, even when chained, are easier targets for theft or graffiti, especially during long hauls.</p>
