    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Loading &amp; unloading</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Containerized carriers often use hydraulic lifts or ramps that keep the bike upright, reducing the risk of drops. Open trailers require manual handling, increasing the chance of accidental damage during bike shifting.</p>
